(9) Environmental conditions are suitable for burning as determined by the fire office of the City of Fort Oglethorpe and Georgia Forestry Commission requirements and the Environmental Protection Agency and Air Pollution Control Bureau regulations.
(10) Either a white permit or a blue permit is issued by the first office of the City of Fort Oglethorpe.
